Charlie Anne Carlson — academic website draft

This is a plain HTML and CSS website. No JavaScript framework or dependency
installation is needed. Edit index.html for content and styles.css for appearance.
The original portrait and site icon are stored in assets/.

Preview: python3 -m http.server 4173 --bind 127.0.0.1
Build static output: python3 build.py

GitHub Pages can serve the files directly from the repository root. The separate
Sites configuration provides a private draft preview. No custom-domain or DNS
configuration is changed by this draft.

Publication and event research is documented in CONTENT_SOURCES.md.
